title: WidgetMessage: tm-confirm
type: text/vnd.tiddlywiki

<<.from-version "5.5.0">> The `tm-confirm` message answers a [[confirmation question|Confirmations]]. It requires the following properties on the `event` object:

|!Name |!Description |
|param |Title of the question tiddler that is being answered |
|paramObject |Hashmap of additional parameters:<br>''answer'': `yes` to confirm the action; any other value declines it |

The confirm message is usually generated with the ButtonWidget by the buttons of the question, and is handled by the TiddlyWiki core.
